dge-lit illumination options. This allows customization to match your branding and interior aesthetics.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation options for these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation can be done either flush against the wall or using standoff mounts, providing flexibility depending on the interior design and mounting surface.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What materials are used to manufacture these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The letters are crafted from high-quality acrylic, metal, or wood, allowing you to select the finish that best fits your interior design theme.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright are these LED letters, and are they suitable for indoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 1,200 nits, these mini channel letters are designed specifically for indoor use, offering clear and vibrant illumination without overwhelming indoor spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is dimming functionality available for these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, optional dimming is available to control the illumination intensity, helping to create the perfect ambiance for your interior environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Mini Channel Letters Indoor compare to traditional large channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Mini Channel Letters Indoor offer a slimmer 1-inch profile ideal for tight indoor spaces, with customizable materials and lighting for subtle yet effective branding, unlike larger outdoor channel letters which are bulkier and brighter.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty do the mini channel letters come with?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty that cover